{"id": "UgzBsCEKcY98LmHxQ7B4AaABAg", "parent": null, "likes": 1, "text": "👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻👍🏻 나훈아의  ㅡ아드님 노래가참좋아요", "published": "2026-09-24T09:58:28", "replies": 0, "creator": false}
